# `harness/agent` implementation

- Fill the `SessionTodo` in the module your session owns. Do not implement a different session's stub unless asked.
- `ProblemCard.source` is always `"json"`. `validate()` must keep passing.
- Register new scorers in both `harness/agent/catalog.py` and `harness.recipes.SCORERS`.
- `decide()` in `policy.py`, `ProcessSpec` / `spec_rate` / `assess_lift` are locked. Do not move keep/revert or "what counts as lift" into the LLM.
- Dry-run (`cx loop <shift> -n`) must stay API-free.
- Artifacts go under `runs/loop_<stamp>/` (append-only iteration dirs if looping).
